				{
					"id": 250220301,
					"content": "这花可真好看。名字也挺好听的…霍莱，你想试吃一下吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250220304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡兹加"
				},
				{
					"id": 250220304,
					"content": "呜呜，呜！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250220305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "霍莱"
				},
				{
					"id": 250220305,
					"content": "（霍莱小心翼翼地嚼了嚼，仔细品尝着花瓣的味道。）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250220306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "霍莱"
				},
				{
					"id": 250220306,
					"content": "呜，呜…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250220307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "霍莱"
				},
				{
					"id": 250220307,
					"content": "喔！看霍莱的样子，它还挺喜欢吃这个的。不过吃花可不能吃饱啊…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250220308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡兹加"
				},
				{
					"id": 250220308,
					"content": "而且，这种花看上去就不太便宜啊…总之我先记下来好了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250220309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡兹加"
				},
				{
					"id": 250220309,
					"content": "花怎么做成食物呢？唔，要不然，把花包在饼里…？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "卡兹加"
				}
			]
		},
